SUMMARY:Intergenerational Service & Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Intergenerational Service and Retreat Journey\nSaint James youth\, adults and families are invited to join us for an intergenerational service and retreat at the Brookland Retreat Center in Pennsylvania’s beautiful Northern Tier. This trip is open to rising 7th graders and older. \nParticipants will return to Potter County for service projects focused on conservancy and restoration. We will learn on indigenous sacred grounds and engage in contemplative practices while enjoying activities like hiking\, swimming and stargazing. This transformative experience will strengthen our connections with one another and support the lives of others.
URL:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/event/intergenerational-service-and-retreat-journey/2026-07-16/
LOCATION:Brookland Retreat Center\, 3714 Fox Hill Rd\, Brookland\, PA\, 16948\, United States
GEO:41.8356983;-77.7952941
